  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Out in the streets",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You won’t survive with wack-ass beats (“We can see that”)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "These days and times",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Watch how we get",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Ours with rhymes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "To my Metal Face bros with stomachs of cast iron",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Who been in to win and blast to the last siren",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "On the slow-mo, the con artist with the so-so chick",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Chased them all like how he did to Slobodan Milošević",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Anyhoo, how ‘bout them Yankees?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Once I leave off-stage, the party people thanks me’s",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "If I may speak freely, nasty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Like the freaky-deaky at your local sleazy speakeasy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "For any fan of the limelight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "In the mic stand was left a lit stick of dynamite",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "It’s risky business like hand-to-hand crack sale",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "With rappers who’s better off on the cover of Black Tail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Jumping Jehoshaphat, who’s that? Who cats who do magic be like, “Tell me how you do’s that”",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Heck no. Especially those who cop pleas like",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Gekko, let go the mic, do techno. Haha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "The best’ll bust out laughing at the vet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "For no reason, you get cussed out like Tourette",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Yet tight flow to make her bad ass stutter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Or even crack a smile from a mad fast cutter",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "But, uh, horror play since third grade age",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Back when we used to play “Bang! Open bird cage”",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Hip hop Benny Hill, sip Henny straight, get every pennyweight",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Then he chill, at any rate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "My Metal Face hoes with tongue or at least eye ring",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Do yourself, I will continue to do my thing like",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Kung fu fighting, everybody was biting",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Then the Supervillain struck again like lightning at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "The same spot (Hzzz!). Now what’s the chance of that?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "And a name drop like pick a name out the hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "That’s an old driver from the liver conniver",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Who vote player out the rap game like Survivor while I",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Drop degrees like a nerd cat, wheeling on ten-speeds",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "From way back, I spin your back and then freeze",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "While I play high-ball, low-ball to zero",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "So-called rhymers, go call Cleo while I",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Steal the show like, “Thought so. Try hiking”",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Super-duper stars need Ortho Tri-Cyclen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Sometimes the men, mostly from the women",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "I hear voices saying, “That’s the Supervillain”",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "(Uhh, I hear voices)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Mostly from the women",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "I hear voices",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Supervillain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCADADDEFGHIJIKLMNOOEPQJQIIIMDRSTDQBBUVBWU",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCACACCDCDDDBDBBEBDDDDCBCDDDECCCFCCBBGHBDG"
    },
    {
